## Required Changes (BiocCheck will flag these)

### 3. Add `biocViews` to DESCRIPTION

Required field — without it the package will not pass the Bioconductor submission form. Suggested tags:

```
biocViews: FlowCytometry, Preprocessing, SingleCell, CellBasedAssays, Clustering
```

### 4. Create `NEWS.md`

Bioconductor requires a `NEWS` or `NEWS.md` file documenting changes between versions. One entry per version, e.g.:

```markdown
# DebarcodeR 1.1.0
- Added cytoframe/cytoset support
- Improved channel name handling (original FCS names; cleaned names deprecated)
- Extracted helper functions for barcode slot access and validation
- Added `show()` method for fcbFlowFrame
- Added tutorial vignette and jurkatFCB_std dataset
```

### 5. Add `URL` and `BugReports` to DESCRIPTION

Bioconductor recommends (and BiocCheck flags absence of) these fields:

```
URL: https://github.com/cytolab/DebarcodeR
BugReports: https://github.com/cytolab/DebarcodeR/issues
```

